### SETUP: doosra user banao (ek hi baar chalega, dobara 409 aayega, koi baat nahi)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Other Student",
  "email": "other@example.com",
  "password": "other1234"
}

### LOGIN as user A (pehle wala test user)
# @name loginA
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### LOGIN as user B (doosra user)
# @name loginB
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "other@example.com",
  "password": "other1234"
}

### TEST 1: Items dekho BINA login
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items

### TEST 2: Items dekho LOGIN ke saath (user A)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}

### TEST 3: Item report karo BINA login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Blue Water Bottle",
  "status": "lost",
  "category": "accessories",
  "description": "Blue steel bottle",
  "location": "Canteen",
  "date": "2026-10-18",
  "contact": "test@example.com"
}

### TEST 4: Item report karo LOGIN ke saath (user A)
# @name createItem
POST http://localhost:3000/api/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Blue Water Bottle",
  "status": "lost",
  "category": "accessories",
  "description": "Blue steel bottle",
  "location": "Canteen",
  "date": "2026-10-18",
  "contact": "test@example.com"
}

### TEST 5: User B us item ko recovered mark kare (rukna chahiye)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/items/{{createItem.response.body.item.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginB.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "recovered"
}

### TEST 6: Owner (user A) recovered mark kare (chalna chahiye)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/items/{{createItem.response.body.item.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "recovered"
}